#: ../../../RISCVSupport.md:1
msgid "RISC-V Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../RISCVSupport.md:7
msgid "Intrinsic Detection Macros"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../RISCVSupport.md:9
msgid ""
"Clang provides macros to detect which RISC-V intrinsics are supported by the "
"toolchain. This is only available if intrinsics are ratified, in other word, "
"experimental intrinsics do not have macro defined. Note: This is independent "
"from assembler support."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../RISCVSupport.md:14
msgid "Intrinsic Detection"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../RISCVSupport.md:16
msgid ""
"Macros of the form `__riscv_intrinsic_<extension>` indicate that the "
"toolchain supports intrinsics for a given extension:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../RISCVSupport.md:30
msgid ""
"Composite extensions are also defined when all their sub-extensions are "
"available, e.g."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../RISCVSupport.md:32
msgid "`__riscv_intrinsic_zkn` - zbkb + zbkc + zbkx + zkne + zknd + zknh"
msgstr ""
